  <main>
    <h2>GIF Example: Dancing Banana</h2>
    <figure>
      <img src="images/bouncing-ball.gif" alt="A yellow cartoon banana with eyes, arms, and legs dancing against a pale background.">
      <figcaption>GIF Example — an original example image made for this project.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <section>
      <h3>Image description</h3>
      <p>This animated image shows a silly banana dancing by swinging its arms and legs.</p>
      <h3>File type information</h3>
      <p>GIF stands for Graphics Interchange Format. It supports simple frame-based animation and is often used for short, looping reactions and jokes.</p>
      <h3>Why I chose this image</h3>
      <p>I chose a dancing banana because funny looping animations are popular online, and GIF is designed to display simple animations.</p>
      <h3>Source</h3>
      <p>This is original artwork created for this assignment, so it does not use an outside image source.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer><p>CSIT 121 · Lab 04 · Web Image Formats</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
